{"id":"5c18af15d55babd2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-true-stage-domination.md","title":"支配真阶段函数即可计算原集合","display":"thm-true-stage-domination — 支配真阶段函数即可计算原集合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-true-stage-domination","aliases":["20-thm-true-stage-domination"],"display":"thm-true-stage-domination — 支配真阶段函数即可计算原集合","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.6(ii) 的 frame 论证","source_printed_pages":[126],"source_pdf_pages":[161],"depends_on":["[[20-df-true-stage-function]]","[[20-df-domination]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-true-stage-domination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-true-stage-domination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-true-stage-domination — 支配真阶段函数即可计算原集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.6(ii) 的 frame 论证"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>126</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"858d5de23691d48d\" href=\"?note=858d5de23691d48d\" title=\"20-df-true-stage-function\">20-df-true-stage-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=c_{a,A}\">\\(c=c_{a,A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(g:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\le^*g\">\\(c\\le^*g\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"858d5de23691d48d\" href=\"?note=858d5de23691d48d\" title=\"20-df-true-stage-function\">20-df-true-stage-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\">\\(a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}true-stage-domination}\\vdash\nA\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}true-stage-domination}\\vdash\nA\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>调整有限多值，并取最大值使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(z)&gt;z\">\\(g(z)&gt;z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(z)\\ge c(z)\">\\(g(z)\\ge c(z)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 成立；调整的有限常数可写入归约。求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x)\">\\(A(x)\\)</span> 时搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z&gt;x\">\\(z&gt;x\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x,t)\">\\(a(x,t)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\le t\\le g(z)\">\\(z\\le t\\le g(z)\\)</span> 内恒定。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 最终稳定，搜索终止；每个这样的 frame 含有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(z)\">\\(c(z)\\)</span>，该阶段在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le z\">\\(y\\le z\\)</span> 上正确，所以恒定值就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x)\">\\(A(x)\\)</span>。只需检查有限区间，未进行无限稳定性判定。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.6(ii) 的 frame 论证；印刷页 126；PDF 第 161 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-true-stage-function","status":"resolved","id":"858d5de23691d48d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-true-stage-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-true-stage-function","status":"resolved","id":"858d5de23691d48d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c=c_{a,A}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c\\le^*g","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2","display":false},{"tex":"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}true-stage-domination}\\vdash\nA\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g).","display":true},{"tex":"g(z)>z","display":false},{"tex":"g(z)\\ge c(z)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"z>x","display":false},{"tex":"a(x,t)","display":false},{"tex":"z\\le t\\le g(z)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"c(z)","display":false},{"tex":"y\\le z","display":false},{"tex":"A(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"5110e3608f32da9d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-true-stage-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-true-stage-domination]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-true-stage-domination]] — 章 5；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-true-stage-domination]]"}],"outgoing":["858d5de23691d48d","2e0726b34b0b1c40","52376918bee1945e"]}